# 印刷 from the programs that run as processes (design 11.22.6), for
# tools/ui_run.py: each makes its pages, hands them to the desktop
# (DT_RQ_PRINT), and the desktop's 印刷設定 comes up over the program's
# window; Enter prints, and the PDF file's link goes on the desktop.
# 基本表計算: the sample sheet, its cells and charts
open 019b15f8-72b8-7151-a57f-149fb1f59a17
expect calc: ready
wait 1500
win 基本表計算
click 900 117
wait 300
key 13 01
expect calc: print
wait 1500
shot print_calc_panel
key 28
expect calc: print answered 0
wait 1500
shot print_calc_done
key 08 01
wait 1500
# マイクロカード: 住所録, the list on paper (its own panel first, then the desktop's)
open 01a0d8c4-5336-7a17-8c28-d3e4f5a6b736
expect mcard: ready
wait 1500
win 住所録
click 400 100
wait 300
key 13 01
expect mcard: print panel
wait 800
shot print_mcard_cards
key 28
expect mcard: print list
wait 1500
shot print_mcard_panel
key 28
expect mcard: print answered 0
wait 1500
shot print_mcard_done
key 08 01
wait 1500
# 予定表: the month shown
open 019d6f00-1a2b-7c3d-8e4f-a1b2c3d4e5f6
expect calendar: ready
wait 1500
win 予定表
click 500 110
wait 300
key 13 01
expect calendar: print month
wait 1500
shot print_cal_panel
key 28
expect calendar: print answered 0
wait 1500
shot print_cal_done
# nothing it did was refused for want of a right
absent !OACV!
